GLEE modifications extract the Acceptance v0 protocol and receipt checks from
the AgentKit action provider into an independent Node.js package, replace Zod
and AgentKit dependencies, add bounded transport and strict request validation,
and supply a standalone CLI, tests, and optional structural wallet adapter.

The JSON content of test/fixtures/receipt.fixture.json is retained from that revision.
Its provenance identifies GLEE service source revision
23501640bb728c4a2ddd121067bf6fdaf6db2d2b, a disposable local Ed25519 key,
and mocked settlement. It contains no production signing key or live-payment
proof. The packaged fixture is used only by tests and the offline demo.

